msgid "The default value is ``&\"Master\"``."
msgstr "默认值为  ``&\"Master\"`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1079 de336b11a46f4139a26812ca22b4497c
msgid "Enables or disables the directional emission cone."
msgstr "启用或禁用方向性发射锥"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1081 d924b3f08c6b4c1ab0bac563e0d89c0e
msgid "When enabled, sound is projected in a cone rather than omnidirectionally."
msgstr "启用后，声音通过锥形区域向外传播。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1095 3eb2c4fcad3c41a2a7567fa53cdae1dd
msgid "Returns ``true`` if the emission angle cone is enabled."
msgstr "如果启用了方向性发射锥，则返回    ``true``"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1097 239ee7444a994b1dbd19a9c8fe64855a
msgid "When enabled, sound is directional within the configured cone."
msgstr "启用后，声音仅在配置的发声锥内具有完整指向性。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:997 5b9d625ae1004665a3cb2bca86048c74
msgid "Sound is at full volume within this cone and attenuated outside."
msgstr "声音在该发声锥内保持完整音量，在锥外衰减。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1127 00ca8521c6d440d7a06ce1145b1d3338
msgid "Returns the inner emission angle in degrees."
msgstr "返回发射内锥角，单位为度"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1129 b242035282754c929c1cc26d30b25ce7
msgid "Sound is at full volume within this cone."
msgstr "发声锥内的声音保持完整音量。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1131 41f4aa5ab1a74a6d97c926da3123320f
msgid "The default value is ``45.0`` degrees."
msgstr "默认值为    ``45.0``    度。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1027 e6d756a55345483da87bf0babb159a40
msgid "More negative values create a sharper directional effect."
msgstr "值越负，方向性效果越明显。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1161 7cd6b7b586274724b1ee46492975db1d
msgid "Returns the attenuation outside the emission cone in dB."
msgstr "返回发射锥外的音量衰减，单位为分贝"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1163 67b8bc21e2814f63bd63f5fee9241f02
msgid "The default value is ``-12.0`` dB."
msgstr "默认值为    ``-12.0``    dB。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1243 44ed9369a3b04265941cce7dd93417e8
msgid "Sets the doppler tracking mode for velocity-based pitch changes."
msgstr "设置多普勒速度追踪模式"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1103 8a6d561afa374c24bd3f029042b2cba8
msgid ""
"See :ref:`DopplerTracking<enum_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_DopplerTracking>` for available "
"options."
msgstr "可用选项见  :ref:`DopplerTracking<enum_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_DopplerTracking>` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1259 fe0a90a9bd4b48ff8938b28bd46342d9
msgid "Returns the current doppler tracking mode."
msgstr "返回当前多普勒速度追踪模式"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1261 f0f9beee57eb4e5c86bd322e374bc43f
msgid "See :ref:`DopplerTracking<enum_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_DopplerTracking>` for possible values."
msgstr "可用值见    :ref:`DopplerTracking<enum_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_DopplerTracking>`   。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:21 76c0fc1eddb74787b7f1ac89c58c56e8
msgid ""
"Plays :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` in 3D using FMOD positioning, rolloff, "
"optional Doppler tracking, and an emission cone. Playback controls, pitch, volume, and bus "
"routing are shared with the other FMOD players."
msgstr ""
"使用 FMOD 的空间定位、距离衰减、可选多普勒跟踪和发射锥，在 3D 空间播放  :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` \\ "
"。播放控制、音调、音量和总线路由与其他 FMOD 播放器共用。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:176 ae347e0ab91d44738bb52526a759f91b
msgid ""
"Emitted when the playback channel ends. Calling "
":ref:`stop()<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_method_stop>` or replacing "
":ref:`stream<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_stream>` does not emit this signal."
msgstr ""
"播放通道结束时发出。调用  :ref:`stop()<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_method_stop>`  或替换  "
":ref:`stream<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_stream>`  不会发出此信号。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:209 1d4855768c27476db81623ab256be3a7
msgid ""
"Uses FMOD inverse-tapered rolloff "
"(:ref:`FmodSystem.FMOD_MODE_3D_INVERSETAPEREDROLLOFF<class_FmodSystem_constant_FMOD_MODE_3D_INVERSETAPEREDROLLOFF>`)."
" This is not a pure inverse-square volume curve."
msgstr ""
"使用 FMOD 的反比渐变衰减（\\  "
":ref:`FmodSystem.FMOD_MODE_3D_INVERSETAPEREDROLLOFF<class_FmodSystem_constant_FMOD_MODE_3D_INVERSETAPEREDROLLOFF>`"
" \\ ），并非纯粹的反平方音量曲线。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:217 9fcf837b247c402692d3bcd080952705
msgid ""
"Uses FMOD linear rolloff between "
":ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>` and "
":ref:`max_distance<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_max_distance>` multiplied by "
":ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>`."
msgstr ""
"在  :ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>`  到  "
":ref:`max_distance<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_max_distance>`  乘以  "
":ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>`  的距离之间，使用 FMOD 线性衰减。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:336 d8c933882c134553bb28fe7bc96382cc
msgid ""
"Minimum rolloff distance in scene units. Also scales "
":ref:`max_distance<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_max_distance>` when configuring "
"FMOD."
msgstr ""
"以场景单位表示的最小衰减距离。配置 FMOD 时也用于缩放  "
":ref:`max_distance<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_max_distance>` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:387 6681277fc9f6438a923d31223ff179ab
msgid "If ``true``, defers playback until the node is ready, outside the editor."
msgstr "为  ``true``  时，在节点就绪后延迟开始播放，在编辑器中不生效。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:438 21b136f5c5c8445fa14b837403a9bca8
msgid ""
"Maximum rolloff distance multiplier. The distance passed to FMOD is this value multiplied by "
":ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>`; it is not a universal "
"hard cutoff."
msgstr ""
"最大衰减距离倍率。传递给 FMOD 的距离为此值乘以  "
":ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>` \\ ，并非所有衰减模型都将其作为硬截断距离。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:474 ae50a46c33b24433b92ef6a9f961906a
msgid "Stored area mask. Area-based audio filtering is not implemented."
msgstr "保存的区域掩码。尚未实现基于区域的音频过滤。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:542
#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1053
#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1065 48de7e87c39a4f32b65182403b00d6d1
#: 6c336e2be165466093d16feee586c06c 770d96f31f1a44f3a0eab6ab873c98c5
msgid ""
"Center frequency passed to FMOD's custom distance filter, in Hz. Clamped to ``10.0`` through "
"``22050.0``."
msgstr "传递给 FMOD 自定义距离滤波器的中心频率，单位为 Hz，限制在  ``10.0``  到  ``22050.0``  之间。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:593 c95333571d0c40319b3aa58e6302ffe8
msgid "Starts or restarts playback at ``from_position``, in seconds. Use a nonnegative position."
msgstr "从  ``from_position``  指定的位置开始或重新播放，单位为秒。位置应为非负数。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:619 03fee261659948799c97e267aa0d77f0
msgid ""
"Returns the playback position in seconds, including while paused. Returns ``0.0`` if there is"
" no valid playback channel."
msgstr "返回播放位置，单位为秒，暂停时仍可查询。没有有效播放通道时返回  ``0.0`` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:643 e1119fd131d246da947ec4f3d481552b
msgid ""
"Stops the current playback and assigns ``stream``. Playback must be started again with "
":ref:`play()<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_method_play>`."
msgstr ""
"停止当前播放并设置  ``stream`` \\ ，之后需调用  :ref:`play()<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_method_play>`  "
"开始播放。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:669 608b67b5182948a1945dfe743f51fe47
msgid ""
"Preloads the assigned stream by creating its internal :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>`. "
"Returns ``false`` if no stream is assigned or sound creation fails."
msgstr "通过创建内部  :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>`  预加载音频流。未设置音频流或声音创建失败时返回  ``false`` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:737 bfe8f6dbb4724bd8883c758fac3543e9
msgid ""
"Sets the minimum rolloff distance in scene units, clamped to at least ``0.001``. Also scales "
":ref:`max_distance<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_max_distance>` when configuring "
"FMOD."
msgstr ""
"设置以场景单位表示的最小衰减距离，最小为  ``0.001`` \\ 。配置 FMOD 时也用于缩放  "
":ref:`max_distance<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_max_distance>` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:749 6bf04e39ec3f43a8bb61e51c5d1e4bd1
msgid "Returns the minimum rolloff distance in scene units."
msgstr "返回以场景单位表示的最小衰减距离。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:803 403ca5327e3d4c55ad0684df7a0b5871
msgid "Returns ``true`` while a playback channel is active, including while paused."
msgstr "播放通道处于活动状态时返回  ``true`` \\ ，暂停时也返回  ``true`` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:815 b7410f552b1e409099dafee7fb7421eb
msgid ""
"Sets :ref:`auto_play<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_auto_play>`. Automatic playback "
"is deferred until the node is ready and is disabled in the editor."
msgstr ""
"设置  :ref:`auto_play<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_auto_play>` \\ "
"。自动播放会延迟到节点就绪后执行，在编辑器中不生效。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:827 9954f17cd2a44b17acb4518f7dbf7ab0
msgid "Returns whether :ref:`auto_play<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_auto_play>` is enabled."
msgstr "返回是否启用了  :ref:`auto_play<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_auto_play>` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:887 d739c16305694ce79d32d06ec8f4f5ed
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum rolloff distance multiplier, clamped to at least ``0.01``. FMOD receives "
"``distance`` multiplied by "
":ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>`. The attenuation model "
"determines behavior beyond that distance."
msgstr ""
"设置最大衰减距离倍率，最小为  ``0.01`` \\ 。传递给 FMOD 的距离为  ``distance``  乘以  "
":ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>` \\ 。超出此距离后的行为由衰减模型决定。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:901 312287353d9d46fcbf4fc8d59f5f2ce5
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum rolloff distance multiplier. Multiply it by "
":ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>` to obtain the distance "
"passed to FMOD."
msgstr ""
"返回最大衰减距离倍率。将其乘以  :ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>`  可得到传递给 "
"FMOD 的距离。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:915 206efb8e52744ad89a8956dc0706ee9d
msgid ""
"Selects the bus used when the next playback channel is created. Changing this value does not "
"reroute an existing channel."
msgstr "设置下次创建播放通道时使用的总线。修改此值不会改变现有通道的路由。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:917 a7968ec4165947348586cc88793696aa
msgid ""
"If the bus is not found in :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>`, playback uses"
" the master channel group."
msgstr "在  :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>`  中找不到该总线时，播放使用主通道组。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:943 9da2815a6af84d0987a37858a6f23714
msgid "Stores ``mask``. Area-based audio filtering is not implemented by this player."
msgstr "保存  ``mask`` \\ 。此播放器尚未实现基于区域的音频过滤。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:955 b236f4fe8def4e718efc7b87bc4846ec
msgid "Returns the stored area mask. It currently has no effect on playback."
msgstr "返回保存的区域掩码，此值目前不影响播放。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:225 7a32b9f806284d8c85a158793d831280
msgid ""
"Uses a flat custom rolloff curve with unity gain at every distance. Preserves 3D panning, "
"Doppler and emission-cone settings. "
":ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>` and "
":ref:`max_distance<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_max_distance>` do not affect "
"distance gain in this mode."
msgstr ""
"使用平坦的自定义衰减曲线，使所有距离处的增益均为 1。保留 3D 声像、多普勒和发声锥设置。此模式下，\\  "
":ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>`  和  "
":ref:`max_distance<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_max_distance>`  不影响距离增益。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:440
#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:891
#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:905 8030786684df4e13bbc1cba4a52783f0
#: cb9187311eb342f397843d2e38060e77 d898fdfb1fed4ddd8aa154113e8dd808
msgid ""
"In :ref:`ATTENUATION_DISABLED<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_constant_ATTENUATION_DISABLED>` "
"mode, a flat custom rolloff curve keeps distance gain at unity regardless of this setting."
msgstr ""
"在  :ref:`ATTENUATION_DISABLED<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_constant_ATTENUATION_DISABLED>`  "
"模式下，平坦的自定义衰减曲线使距离增益始终为 1，不受此设置影响。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:508 5310d9f82e23451a91ecdbc7fbfbd604
msgid ""
"Inner emission angle in degrees, clamped to ``0.0`` through ``90.0``. The inspector and saved"
" scenes use degrees without conversion."
msgstr "发声内锥角，单位为度，限制在  ``0.0``  到  ``90.0``  之间。检查器和保存的场景直接使用度数，无需转换。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:525 49a167763484460a86a6eca93dc33af0
msgid "Attenuation outside the emission cone in dB, clamped to ``-80.0`` through ``0.0``."
msgstr "发声锥外的衰减量，单位为 dB，限制在  ``-80.0``  到  ``0.0``  之间。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:559 f24a18396de64128bf7c8a4765adf26b
msgid ""
"Distance-filter level in dB, clamped to ``-80.0`` through ``0.0``. ``0.0`` bypasses "
"filtering; more negative values increase filtering around "
":ref:`attenuation_filter_cutoff_hz<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_attenuation_filter_cutoff_hz>`."
" This controls filter strength, not a uniform volume reduction."
msgstr ""
"距离滤波级别，单位为 dB，限制在  ``-80.0``  到  ``0.0``  之间。\\  ``0.0``  旁路滤波，数值越负，\\  "
":ref:`attenuation_filter_cutoff_hz<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_attenuation_filter_cutoff_hz>`"
"  附近的滤波越强。此属性控制滤波强度，并非整体音量衰减。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:561 398df7077038406eae012e2b2c977ff1
msgid ""
"The player converts dB to the native filter amount as ``1 - pow(10, db / 20)``. Requires "
"``audio/fmod/init_flags/channel_distance_filter`` to be enabled before the FMOD system is "
"initialized. Restart the project after changing this setting."
msgstr ""
"播放器使用  ``1 - pow(10, db / 20)``  将 dB 转换为原生滤波量。需要在 FMOD 系统初始化前启用  "
"``audio/fmod/init_flags/channel_distance_filter`` \\ ，修改此设置后请重启项目。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:997 f029baf12aa84cf39f10af97a5b2fbf9
msgid ""
"Sets the inner emission angle in degrees, clamped to ``0.0`` through ``90.0``. The inspector "
"and saved scenes use degrees without conversion."
msgstr "设置发声内锥角，单位为度，限制在  ``0.0``  到  ``90.0``  之间。检查器和保存的场景直接使用度数，无需转换。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1027 c85d2c6c70854e62a4704b744cde1064
msgid "Sets the attenuation outside the emission cone in dB, clamped to ``-80.0`` through ``0.0``."
msgstr "设置发声锥外的衰减量，单位为 dB，限制在  ``-80.0``  到  ``0.0``  之间。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1079 8aad98cffa88452295e6aff18ca426c7
msgid ""
"Sets "
":ref:`attenuation_filter_db<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_attenuation_filter_db>`. "
"Updates the native filter immediately during playback."
msgstr ""
"设置  "
":ref:`attenuation_filter_db<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_attenuation_filter_db>` \\"
" 。播放期间会立即更新原生滤波器。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1091 82a0ab4e2a134968be3cbb217a542872
msgid ""
"Returns "
":ref:`attenuation_filter_db<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_attenuation_filter_db>` in"
" dB."
msgstr ""
"返回  "
":ref:`attenuation_filter_db<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_attenuation_filter_db>` \\"
" ，单位为 dB。"
